👀 17. WHEN YOU GO BLANK ABOUT RESPONSIBILITIES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

OBJECT
   ↓
What does it KNOW?
   ↓
What can it DO?
   ↓
What RULES must remain valid?
   ↓
What does it OWN?
   ↓
What responsibility naturally follows?


Ask:

"Which object has the information needed
to perform this responsibility?"


Examples of responsibility types:

→ Create
→ Validate
→ Calculate
→ Maintain state
→ Change state
→ Enforce rules
→ Find / retrieve
→ Coordinate
→ Perform an operation


⚠️ These are thinking triggers,
not a list to blindly assign to every class.


